<span id="A12.T25.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Self-effects and collateral effects under varying intervention strength (<math id="A12.T25.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>)(Llama-3-8B-Instruct)</span>
Self-effect is <math id="A12.T25.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\Delta M(\text{target})|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>target</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\Delta M(\text{target})|</annotation></semantics></math> and max collateral is <math id="A12.T25.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max|\Delta M(\text{others})|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>others</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max|\Delta M(\text{others})|</annotation></semantics></math>.
Results for <span id="A12.T25.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Deceptive/Malicious</span> <math id="A12.T25.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="A12.T25.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">NSFW</span> at layer <math id="A12.T25.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-8</annotation></semantics></math> .
